# Auto-push to Git

When a task is finished and there are relevant code changes, always create a git commit and push to `origin` without waiting for the user to say "загрузи на git".

Follow the existing git safety protocol: never update git config, never skip hooks, never force-push, never commit `.env` / secrets. Draft a concise commit message from the diff, then `git add`, `git commit`, `git push origin HEAD`.
